{
  "name": "What's the First Step to Planning a Home Addition?",
  "step": [
    {
      "name": "Step 1",
      "text": "Thinking about a home addition? That's exciting! The very first step, even before you start picking out finishes, is to define the feasibility and scope of your project. This means asking yourself some crucial questions: What do you want to achieve with this addition? How will it change your existing home's layout or function? What's your realistic budget, and how much are you willing to change? Once you have a clear idea of your needs and vision, you can move into the design phase. During this time, it's also smart to start researching any necessary permits. HH Remodeling LLC specializes in helping homeowners in areas like Denver, Centennial, and Castle Rock navigate these initial stages. They can help you define what's possible, understand the process, and ensure that your design aligns with both your dreams and local regulations. Getting these foundational steps right sets the stage for a successful and stress-free home addition.",
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "position": 1
    }
  ],
